<title>USA: Organogenesis gets FDA OK to market product.</title>
<headline>Organogenesis gets FDA OK to market product.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Organogenesis Inc said Friday the Federal Drug Administration approved the marketing of its surgical product Graftpatch.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to market the product, which is used in surgical procedures to reinforce soft tissue, through a partner with an established presence in the hospital and surgical market.</p>
<p>The manfacturer of therapeutics containing natural tissue components holds three U.S. patents relating to Graftpatch.</p>
</text>
